The estimated model size~$\widehat m$ is a ‘{stopping time}':~$\widehat m\in[K-1]$ and, for all~$a\in[K-1]$,
\begin{equation}
\tag{$\bf\mathcal A_{\mathrm{\,Stop}}$} \mathds 1_{\{\widehat m\leq a\}}\text{~is a measurable function of~}(\lambda_1, \ldots, \lambda_a, \widehat \imath_1,\ldots, \widehat \imath_{K})\,.
\end{equation}

